    rdf:value """Thursday, Aug. 10, 1905
Fine.
Cold. In bed. Balzac. Mildred Whitall came.
Fine. Cold.
Mildred left. Balzac.
Fine. Cold.
Friday, Aug. 11, 1905
Saturday, Aug. 12, 1905
Walked down to swimming pond.
Sunday, Aug. 13, 1905
Fine.
Cold. Balzac and letters."""^^xsd:string ;
